  ["**Grassland**", "Moderate rainfall, not enough for dense forest", "Grass, few trees; grazing animals", "**Temperate:** prairies (N. America), steppes (Asia), fertile, farming. **Tropical:** savannas (Africa), lions, elephants, giraffes"],
